cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenAMRobot in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenAMRobot: open-source dual-arm mobile manipulator for embodied AI"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Botshare Ltd"
  - family-names: "Reznichenko"
    given-names: "Alex"
repository-code: "https://github.com/openAMRobot/openamrobot-release"
url: "https://docs.openamrobot.ai"
abstract: >-
  OpenAMRobot is a general-purpose open-source mobile manipulation
  platform for embodied AI: a differential-drive mobile base, a lift
  and two arms, ROS 2 software, firmware, CAD and documentation.
  Domain experts teach it tasks by demonstration.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - ros2
  - embodied-ai
  - mobile-manipulation
  - open-hardware
